    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability including outside office hours (24/7 services): our hosting options include an availability target of 99.9%, which implies high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, specific details about 24/7 services are not provided in the context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our capabilities in providing 24/7 operation on the appropriate hosting tier, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI)): Our platform Atelier has standard connectors for SIH/DPI integration, which means this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent within the European Union: our have a hosting option called Sovereign HDS tier provided by OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and located within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR): Our platform Atelier supports HL7 and FHIR through our partner Ligeo Santé for health interoperability, which means Support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR): is FULLY COVERED. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "National health identifier (INS) and national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP): our support the Ségur/Mon espace santé–DMP framework, but specific details about National health identifier (INS) are not provided in our context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, given our alignment with the mentioned frameworks, this requirement can be considered PARTIALLY COVERED, as our do not have explicit information on National health identifier (INS)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: The proposed architecture would utilize our Atelier platform hosted on OuraneCloud Sovereign HDS tier to ensure high availability and compliance with EU regulations. our will leverage our standard connectors for integrating with the hospital's SIH and DPI systems, ensuring seamless data exchange." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our will work with our partner Ligeo Santé to implement HL7/FHIR standards for health interoperability and align with the Ségur/Mon espace santé–DMP framework. our API-first approach (REST + webhook) allows for easy integration and embedding within existing environments, facilitating the implementation of the required functionalities while meeting performance and availability expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for the infrastructure, explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The health data is classified as special-category data under GDPR Art. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our compliance risks, and are our certified to host sensitive health data in accordance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have certifications that address some of the requirements mentioned. our are ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers Development, delivery and operations, and our also have ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our have HDS certification through our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection measures, our use encryption in transit with TLS 1.3, encryption at rest with AES-256, and our have key management on EU-based infrastructure. our also implement pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, the solution supports explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is essential to note that while our have HDS certification through OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, the specific requirements for hosting sensitive health data classified as special-category data under GDPR Art. 9 must be carefully reviewed to ensure compliance with all applicable regulations. our main compliance risk would be ensuring that our current certifications and data protection measures fully meet the strict GDPR compliance requirements specified in The tender, particularly concerning the handling of special-category health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, our existing certifications and data protection measures provide a solid foundation for addressing the strict GDPR compliance requirements specified in the tender, particularly concerning the handling of special-category health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict compliance with the GDPR, medical confidentiality (secret médical), and French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for the hosting infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are we legally eligible to provide such services, and do we standard contractual clauses cover these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, which suggests we are familiar with French regulations. we regulatory compliance monitoring includes the GDPR (including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements), medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the client's demands, we is capable of ensuring strict compliance with the GDPR, as we have experience with the GDPR requirements, including those related to special category data (Article 9). we also understand the importance of medical confidentiality (secret médical) and can ensure that we services comply with this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we are aware of French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for the hosting infrastructure. our standard contractual clauses likely include provisions for the GDPR compliance, given we experience with French public procurement and we administrative attestations available for such purposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to confirm whether our standard contractual clauses explicitly cover all the client's requirements, including medical confidentiality and HDS certification, a review of we specific contracts would be necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of not automating clinical or medico-administrative decisions without explicit validation by a qualified professional, our company context suggests we are aware of the need for human oversight in critical decision-making processes, especially in healthcare. we approach to providing AI solutions as assistance tools rather than decision-making authorities aligns with the need for human oversight in critical decision-making processes, especially in healthcare." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, based on our company context, it appears that we is legally eligible to provide services that comply with the client's requirements regarding the GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS certification, and the non-automation of clinical decisions without professional validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, a detailed examination of we contractual clauses and compliance documents would be required to ensure full alignment with all specified demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 900,000 over 5 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose while guaranteeing the expected quality of service?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the company context, The global budget allocated to the project is €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The cost structure includes one-off project costs such as framing, design, integration, change management, and training, which account for 30% of The global budget allocated to the project, and recurring run costs such as platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance, which account for 70% of The global budget allocated to the project. our pricing model has a target gross margin between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate The global budget allocated to the project, our need to consider The cost structure and our pricing model." ;
